  m_Name: Cylinder.003_Material.008_0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Bolt (2)
  description: The Bolt (2) is a tiny, thin-flat fastener located at the bottom-center-rear
    of the V8HotRed engine, playing a crucial role in securing components together.
    Its small size and material composition, made of Material.008, allow it to withstand
    high stresses while maintaining a low profile. Interestingly, the bolt's thin-flat
    shape enables it to fit into tight spaces, making it an essential component for
    the engine's overall structural integrity.
